/ Layout for ViewComponent previews (Lookbook).
/
/ Deliberately not the application layout: that one renders layouts/_header,
/ which reads current_user.avatar, and a preview has nobody signed in. This
/ pulls in the same head — so Vite assets and Tailwind apply — and nothing else.
/
/ Only the icons controller is attached. The theme controller requires its
/ checkbox target, which lives in the header this layout does not render, and
/ raises "Missing target element" on connect without it.
doctype html
html[lang="en"]
  head
    = render 'layouts/head'
  body.p-8 data-controller="icons"
    = yield
